definition_en:
[business] n. the amount of attention something gets from the public or media
n. vulnerability to the elements; to the action of heat or cold or wind or rain;
n. the act of subjecting someone to an influencing experience

[business] n. used in "on behalf of", meaning representing someone
n. as the agent of or on someone's part (usually expressed as "on behalf of" rather than "in behalf of");
n. for someone's benefit (usually expressed as `in behalf' rather than `on behalf' and usually with a possessive)
